===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|carpentry}} Full extent; distance between extreme limits; especially; the distance between the nearest surfaces of two bodies, or the space between walls.
#: {{ux|en|a room ten feet square in the '''clear'''}}
# {{lb|en|video games}} The [[completion]] of a [[stage]] or [[challenge]], or of the whole game.
#: {{ux|en|It took me weeks to achieve a one-credit '''clear''' ([[1CC]]).}}
# {{lb|en|Scientology}} A person who is free from the influence of [[engram]]s.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1985|author=Rodney Stark; William Sims Bainbridge|title=The Future of Religion|page=269
|passage=Today, clear status can be conferred only by high ranking ministers of the church, and '''clears''' are not presented for examination by outsiders.}}

